WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.059 --> 00:00:04.513
Toad fought with the raccoon in the speeding car.

2
00:00:04.514 --> 00:00:08.924
The car went side to side on the road.

3
00:00:08.925 --> 00:00:12.219
"Give me the wheel!" cried the raccoon.

4
00:00:12.220 --> 00:00:17.643
"Get your hands off me!" yelled Toad.

5
00:00:17.644 --> 00:00:22.302
Toad grabbed the wheel with all his might.

6
00:00:22.303 --> 00:00:25.069
The car turned suddenly.

7
00:00:25.070 --> 00:00:29.135
"Ahhh!" cried Toad.

8
00:00:29.136 --> 00:00:33.959
The car crashed through a row of bushes.

9
00:00:33.960 --> 00:00:38.415
"Oh no!" cried the raccoon.

10
00:00:38.416 --> 00:00:44.135
Then the car crashed into a muddy pond.

11
00:00:44.136 --> 00:00:47.216
Toad bounced out of the car.

12
00:00:47.217 --> 00:00:50.581
He landed in soft grass.

13
00:00:50.582 --> 00:00:56.312
The driver and his friends landed in the mud

14
00:00:56.313 --> 00:01:00.767
. "Look at you!" laughed

15
00:01:00.768 --> 00:01:04.751
Toad. "Call the police!" they yelled.

16
00:01:04.752 --> 00:01:09.830
"I have to escape!" cried Toad.

17
00:01:09.831 --> 00:01:12.800
Toad hopped up and ran.

18
00:01:12.801 --> 00:01:15.268
He climbed over fences.

19
00:01:15.269 --> 00:01:17.921
He jumped across ditches.

20
00:01:17.922 --> 00:01:21.082
He crawled through bushes.

21
00:01:21.083 --> 00:01:26.911
Toad ran and ran until he was far away.

22
00:01:26.912 --> 00:01:31.869
"Toad wins again!" he laughed.

23
00:01:31.870 --> 00:01:35.354
He walked happily through a field.

24
00:01:35.355 --> 00:01:39.116
He sang a little song.

25
00:01:39.117 --> 00:01:42.701
"Who asked them to give him a ride?

26
00:01:42.702 --> 00:01:45.709
Clever Toad!

27
00:01:45.710 --> 00:01:49.162
Who tricked them to let him drive?

28
00:01:49.163 --> 00:01:52.322
Clever Toad!

29
00:01:52.323 --> 00:01:54.903
"Who made them muddy and mad?

30
00:01:54.904 --> 00:01:57.504
Who made them sorry and sad?

31
00:01:57.505 --> 00:02:02.463
Who escaped and feels so glad?

32
00:02:02.464 --> 00:02:11.365
Clever Toad! Clever Toad!"

